{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04567","headline":"蜀路二首 二 · 张说","name":"蜀路二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"徭蜀时未改，别家乡念盈。\n忆昨出门日，春风发鲜荣。\n及兹旋辕地，秋风满路生。\n昏晓思魏阙，梦寐还秦京。\n秦京开朱第，魏阙垂紫缨。\n幽独玄虚阁，不闻人马声。\n艺业爲君重，名位爲君轻。\n玉琴知调苦，宝镜对胆清。\n鹰饥常啄腥，凤饥亦待琼。\n於君自有属，物外岂能轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04567.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04567","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}